  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1ff6d8c7-d774-4de9-a7c3-32800b07d647.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">沉浸式護甲HUD會在現有護甲強度條上方，顯示你目前穿戴的護甲類型資訊，並附帶耐久度提示，讓你知道哪些護甲即將損壞。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_adc95858-ae19-4253-9305-8ec77c5adf63.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveArmorHUD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73cfb5b5-93f7-488c-9cb3-ed62cf86ede2.png\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">沉浸式護甲HUD使用自訂的7x7迷你護甲圖示來呈現護甲資訊，這些圖示經過精心設計，像素完美且與原版護甲條對齊：</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_59042282-3ebb-4564-a617-3e740116df1c.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">它與其他模組如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">溢滿血條（Overflowing Bars）</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-rpg-resource-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態RPG資源條（Dynamic RPG Resource Bars）</a>也能完美兼容：</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1228923/description_e7032f55-b3f2-442b-802c-f8abeaf735ac.png\" width=\"850\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">護甲HUD條的位置和偏移量均可調整——你可以將它切換到右側，或手動調整X軸和Y軸位置。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">此外，此模組也提供對其他模組的兼容支援，目前僅支援來自「天境（The Aether）」的護甲。</p>",
